  "description": "国密加解模块\n\t\tusing KayiCloud.Guomi.Security;\n\t\tSM2加解密：\n\t\t加密：string cipherText = SM2Utils.Encrypt(pubk, msg, SM2EngineMode.C1C2C3);\n\t\t解密：string plainText = SM2Utils.Decrypt(prik, cipherText, SM2EngineMode.C1C2C3);\n\n\t\tSM4加解密：\n\t\tSM4Utils sm4 = new SM4Utils(secretKey, Encoding.UTF8);\n\t\t//sm4.secretKey = secretKey; //密钥16个字节\n\t\t//sm4.iv = \"1234567890123456\"; //初始向量16个字节，用于cbc加解密\n\t\t//sm4.hexString = false;\n\t\t加密：string cipher = sm4.Encrypt_ECB(msg);\n\t\t解密：string plainText = sm4.Decrypt_ECB(cipher);",
